{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24934","headline":"淮南游故居感旧酬西川李尚书德裕 · 王播","name":"淮南游故居感旧酬西川李尚书德裕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔年献赋去江湄，今日行春到却悲。\n三径仅存新竹树，四邻惟见旧孙儿。\n壁间潜认偷光处，川上宁忘结网时。\n更见桥边记名姓，始知题柱免人嗤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王播","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24934.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24934","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}